# Agenda and the command line

Every note feeds wtf query @today, wtf query @week, and wtf query @tasks.

- [ ] Send the invoice @due(2026-09-18) #finance
- [ ] Renew the domain @due(2026-09-30) @every(year) #admin
- [ ] Draft the talk @scheduled(2026-09-19) @estimate(2h)
- Standup @at(2026-09-18T09:00-04:00)

<!-- wtf query '@tasks | where contains(tags, "finance")' filters by tag; wtf complete 29-agenda-and-cli.wtf:5
ticks a box; wtf capture "Call the dentist" --due "next Friday" appends to
inbox.wtf; wtf query @check --fail-on-match reports errors. Query plans for
solutions, and use wtf refresh to fill caches. Add --json to a query. -->
